	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - CHARGER BATTERY\n\nBQ25792 buck-boost charger, power path, 2S Li-ion.\nVBUS_USER in, VSYS out (6.0-8.4 V), BAT via shunt (PM1 ch2, bidirectional).\nNTC on TS pin. I2C + INT to P4. BC1.2 (D+/D-) detection DISABLED / not connected.\nBattery connector (JST-PH/XH TBC), pack protection if cells unprotected.\nVSYS shunt -> PM1 ch3."
